sceneDescriptions.description:
Emma — a preschooler-looks girl with brown wavy ear-length hair in a ponytail with a side part on the right, brown eyes, freckles, and small stud earrings, soft rounded features — stands in the open cellar doorway in the foreground, facing slightly into the dark stairwell, one arm extended forward with fingers spread flat against the door frame. The doorway is set in a pale interior wall; beyond the threshold the wooden staircase descends steeply into near-total darkness, the steps barely visible as dark horizontal shapes fading into black. A thin strip of warm kitchen light spills across Emma's left side from behind her, leaving her right side in deep shadow. The darkness of the stairwell fills the right two-thirds of the frame. No other characters are visible in the frame — Noah is already below, off-frame. Close-up shot, high contrast between warm kitchen light and cold dark stairwell, tense quiet atmosphere.

